 of nowhere, they're suddenly forced to work together. Gavriil wakes up alone in a cold, pitch-black cave\u2014his leg missing, and Yeva claiming she saved his life. There\u2019s no sign of rescue. No way to call for help ... This was supposed to be just a short vacation.", "summary": "Vacation Terminal is a short 2D psychological thriller, horror and survival based visual novel with evading based puzzle elements. Following the story of two strangers, Gavriil and Yeva, who suddenly find themselves stranded in the snowy wilderness after a brutal train crash. To survive, they must put trust each in each other and lean on the hope for eventual rescue.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/vacation-terminal", "videos": [{"id": 163610, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "m8-oVNUeMaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m8-oVNUeMaE", "title": "Vacation Terminal Trailer (Horror visual novel)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/m8-oVNUeMaE/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}